sequenceDiagram
    participant Gmail as Gmail Inbox
    participant PubSub as Pub/Sub Topic
    participant Ingestor as pcn-ingestor
    participant GmailAPI as Gmail API
    participant Firestore as Firestore
    participant GCS as GCS Bucket

    Gmail->>PubSub: New mail arrives (watch() notification)
    PubSub->>Ingestor: POST / (push, OIDC signed)
    Ingestor->>Ingestor: Verify OIDC token audience
    Ingestor->>Firestore: Read last_history_id
    Ingestor->>GmailAPI: history.list(startHistoryId)
    GmailAPI-->>Ingestor: New message ID(s)
    Ingestor->>GmailAPI: messages.get(id)
    GmailAPI-->>Ingestor: Message + headers
    Ingestor->>Ingestor: Check From header vs ALLOWED_SENDERS
    alt sender not allowed
        Ingestor->>Firestore: Log rejection, advance history
        Ingestor-->>PubSub: 200 OK
    else sender allowed
        Ingestor->>GmailAPI: attachments.get(PDF)
        GmailAPI-->>Ingestor: PDF bytes (base64url)
        Ingestor->>GCS: Upload PDF to pcn-raw-documents
        Ingestor->>Firestore: Update last_history_id
        Ingestor-->>PubSub: 200 OK
    end
